Roro Ke Kaha Maa Ne Jhula Main Jhulaoungi<br>
Aye Laal Mere Aaja Godi Me Sulaoungi<br>
<br>
Aye Sher Mere Mujko Tu Jaan Se Pyara Hai<br>
Iss Ghamzada Madar Ka Tuhi Tho Sahara Hai<br>
Bin Tere Mere Beta Main Jee Nahin Paoungi<br>
<br>
Iss Tapte Hue Ban Me Tu Soo Nahi Paega<br>
Maa Royegi Tu Jab Tak Wapas Nahi Aayega<br>
Aaja Tuje Mamta Ke Saye Me Sulaoungi<br>
<br>
Bikhre Hue Lashe Hai Khoon Behra Hai Maqtal Me<br>
Darjaye Tu Na Beta Iss Mout Ke Jungle Me<br>
Aaja Main Tuje Apni Goud Me Chupaoungi<br>
<br>
Taklif Nahi Dena Tum Apne Baradar Ko<br>
Gar Tum Nahin Asakte Awaaz Do Madar Ko<br>
Maqtal Se Tumhe Lene Main Khud Chali Aaoungi<br>
<br>
Ek Hashr Hua Barpa Akbar Ye Sada Sunke<br>
Jab Jate Hue Ran Se Mud Ke Kaha Maa Ne<br>
Ghabrana Nahi Beta Main Lout Ke Aaoungi